    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="removed-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Removed from Lua. It can be used in the llcompat library</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Request <b>limit</b> bytes to be reserved for this script.</p>
  <p>Returns the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if the memory limit was successfully set (or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> if not).</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Limit / limit</td>
          <td>The amount to reserve, which must be less than the allowed maximum (currently 64KB) and not already have been exceeded.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

